== Practical ==
P: n = 8 doubles: 8 a-lines (sets 0-7) + 8 b-lines (sets 0-7) = 16 lines; 8 sets x 2 ways = 16 slots; n = 512: row = 4096 bytes = sets x line, so a column's lines share one set: 512 lines in 12 ways
P: ratios of the measured times are computed by run.sh from transpose_time.out (transpose_time_ratios.out)
